###  http://www.semanticweb.org/guilhermepinho/ontologies/2026/4/untitled-ontology-76#apanhou
:apanhou rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
         rdfs:domain :Personagem ;
         rdfs:range :Objeto .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/guilhermepinho/ontologies/2026/4/untitled-ontology-76#aproximouSeDe
:aproximouSeDe rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
