:Objeto rdf:type owl:Class .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/guilhermepinho/ontologies/2026/4/untitled-ontology-76#Personagem
:Personagem rdf:type owl:Class .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/guilhermepinho/ontologies/2026/4/untitled-ontology-76#Raposa
:Raposa rdf:type owl:Class ;
        owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( :Animal
                                                   [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                     owl:onProperty :temTipo ;
                                                     owl:hasValue "raposa"
                                                   ]
                                                 ) ;
